      "sourceTextSha256": "2a1616adb6a2cb2d98337d1baa8d719539736a29a51553979af5385be5985ac8",
      "text": "Day 3 · Breakfast and flight to Cusco; meeting and transfer to the hotel. In the afternoon, visit Sacsayhuamán, a sacred Inca complex; the Qorikancha, the Temple of the Sun, whose walls were once lined with gold and on whose foundations the Spaniards built their monastery, whose collapse in an earthquake revealed the strong Inca walls beneath; Tambomachay, the Inca water temple with baths fed by carefully built channels; and nearby Puka Pukara, the Red Fortress. Optional: a guided visit of the Cathedral of Cusco.\n\nA 40-minute guided visit of the Cathedral before the city tour. $ 25 per person",
